<p><strong class="selflink">Cutscene effects</strong> are shaders that can used in a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Cutscene" title="Cutscene">cutscene</a> for dramatic effect. The effects can be applied either to the MASTER object (in which case they apply to all cameras in the cutscene simultaneously) or to individual cameras.
</p>
