<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Bloom">Bloom</span></h2>
<p>Causes bright areas of the image to "bleed" over into adjacent dark areas, and to oversaturate the camera.
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Curve%20editor" title="Curve editor">curve editor</a> can be used to set the following parameters:
</p>
<ul><li>Brightness</li>
<li>Contrast</li>
<li>Glow intensity</li>
<li>Horizontal blur width</li>
<li>Vertical blur width</li></ul>
