<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Depth_of_Field_.28DOF.29">Depth of Field (DOF)</span></h2>
<p>Sets the camera's focus on near/far objects. By default all objects are in focus regardless of how far away they are, but a real-world camera has a limited ability to focus on objects of differing ranges.
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Curve%20editor" title="Curve editor">curve editor</a> can be used to set the following properties:
</p>
<ul><li>Far fade</li>
<li>Focal radius</li>
<li>Focus distance</li>
<li>Max blur</li>
<li>Near fade</li>
<li>Weight blur</li></ul>
